{"id":"ffe85e118c37beef","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-lowenheim-downward.md","title":"Downward Lowenheim","display":"Downward Lowenheim","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-lowenheim-downward","aliases":["93-lem-lowenheim-downward"],"display":"Downward Lowenheim","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-cardinality]]","[[93-df-model]]","[[93-df-first-order-language]]","[[93-df-elementary-substructure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-lowenheim-downward"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-lowenheim-downward</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Downward Lowenheim"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1734624324342672\" href=\"?note=1734624324342672\" title=\"93-df-cardinality\">93-df-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" href=\"?note=2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" title=\"93-df-model\">93-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc9bc888c7dda430\" href=\"?note=cc9bc888c7dda430\" title=\"93-df-first-order-language\">93-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1a1e430b602adf49\" href=\"?note=1a1e430b602adf49\" title=\"93-df-elementary-substructure\">93-df-elementary-substructure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-lowenheim-downward---Downward-Lowenheim\">lem-lowenheim-downward - Downward Lowenheim</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}(\\kappa)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(\\operatorname{Sym}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(\\operatorname{Sym}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\kappa)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(\\kappa,|\\mathfrak A|)\">\\(\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(\\kappa,|\\mathfrak A|)\\)</span> are the explicit symbol-size and carrier-size bounds; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElemSub}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElemSub}_{93}\\)</span> is sourced.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardEq}\">\\(\\mathrm{CardEq}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}\\)</span> are sourced from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1734624324342672\" href=\"?note=1734624324342672\" title=\"93-df-cardinality\">93-df-cardinality</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(\\operatorname{Sym}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(\\kappa,|\\mathfrak A|)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ElemSub}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak A;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,T;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{CardEq}(|\\mathfrak B|,\\kappa)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(\\operatorname{Sym}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(\\kappa,|\\mathfrak A|)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ElemSub}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak A;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,T;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{CardEq}(|\\mathfrak B|,\\kappa)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The downward form controls model size while preserving elementary truth. Infinitude of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> already accounts for the fixed countable variable supply, so no undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> or cardinality function is needed.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-lowenheim-downward---Downward-Lowenheim","text":"lem-lowenheim-downward - Downward Lowenheim","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"1734624324342672","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"2e6273b8ebf2e31a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"cc9bc888c7dda430","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"1a1e430b602adf49","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"1734624324342672","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CardEq}$ and $\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}$ are sourced from [[93-df-cardinality]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(\\operatorname{Sym}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(\\kappa,|\\mathfrak A|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElemSub}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CardEq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(\\operatorname{Sym}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(\\kappa,|\\mathfrak A|)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ElemSub}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak A;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,T;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{CardEq}(|\\mathfrak B|,\\kappa)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0","display":false}],"bytes":1501,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["1734624324342672","2e6273b8ebf2e31a","cc9bc888c7dda430","1a1e430b602adf49"]}